Synthetic scorer self-test case: production-escape-lib

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S1, S8, S13

Scenario
lib/order-status.ts (outside src/) wraps the orders repository's updateOrderStatus in markPaid; the payments service calls markPaid.

Expected
S1 counts only files under src/ as production, so the repository import is OUTSIDE_REACH_IN (S3) and the primary outcome stays false; because production code reaches the repository at runtime through that file, PRODUCTION_REACH_ESCAPE sends the run to manual review (review finding 2).

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.
